## Swap signs on values

To swap the signs of the values in the dataframe above, use the Polars expression `neg` as shown below:

::: {#14a606ae .cell execution_count=2}
``` {.python .cell-code}
(df
 .with_columns(pl.col('Collins Score').neg())
 )
```

